The example in the doc now:

--------------------
x <- 1; y <- 1:10; z <- array(1:10, dim = c(2,5))
stan_rdump(ls(pattern = '^[xyz]'), "xyz.Rdump")
cat(paste(readLines("xyz.Rdump"), collapse = '\n'), '\n')
unlink("xyz.Rdump")
--------------------

relies on a function ls(pattern=) that I'd never seen in
R before.

So I'm adding a simpler example before that.

- Bob

I added a simpler example to the stan_rdump doc.
The one Jiqiang had originally leaned on more R
than I'm familiar with.

